mperature of liquid\ntoo high\n7. Air cannot escape on\npressure side", "page_text_start": null, "page_text_end": null, "page_text_source": null, "bbox": {"x0": 196.13, "top": 111.98, "x1": 349.27, "bottom": 343.61}}, {"cell_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r001:c02", "table_id": "MP004:p0011:t00", "row_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r001", "row_group_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r001", "row_index": 1, "column_index": 2, "column_name": "REMEDY", "column_role": "inspection_or_maintenance", "text": "Fill pump casing with liquid\nRemove foreign body in\npump/Remove any coating\non mating faces\nChange direction of rotation\nLower suction pipe/Tighten\nsuction line\nChange the pressure line so\nthat the air can pass out\nfreely\nReplace liquid in pump\ncasing/Wrong dimensioning/\nContact DESMI\nVentilate the system", "page_text_start": null, "page_text_end": null, "page_text_source": null, "bbox": {"x0": 349.27, "top": 111.98, "x1": 512.38, "bottom": 343.61}}]}, {"row_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_group_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_index": 2, "cells": [{"cell_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002:c00", "table_id": "MP004:p0011:t00", "row_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_group_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_index": 2, "column_index": 0, "column_name": "FAULT", "column_role": "fault_or_symptom", "text": "The pump has no or\ntoo low capacity", "page_text_start": null, "page_text_end": null, "page_text_source": null, "bbox": {"x0": 65.784, "top": 343.61, "x1": 196.13, "bottom": 751.44}}, {"cell_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002:c01", "table_id": "MP004:p0011:t00", "row_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_group_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_index": 2, "column_index": 1, "column_name": "CAUSE", "column_role": "cause_or_mechanism", "text": "1. Wrong direction of\nrotation\n2. Piping system choked\n3. The pump is choked\n4. Suction line leaks,\npump takes air\n5. Suction lift too high\n6. Pump and piping\nsystem wrongly\ndimensioned\n7. RPM too low", "page_text_start": null, "page_text_end": null, "page_text_source": null, "bbox": {"x0": 196.13, "top": 343.61, "x1": 349.27, "bottom": 751.44}}, {"cell_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002:c02", "table_id": "MP004:p0011:t00", "row_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_group_id": "MP004:p0011:t00:r002", "row_index": 2, "column_index": 2, "column_name": "REMEDY", "column_role": "inspection_or_maintenance", "text": "Change direction of rotation\nto clockwise when viewed\nfrom shaft end (the direction\nof the arrow)\nClean or replace\nClean the pump\nFind the leakage, repair the\nfault, non-return valve not\nsubmerged\nCheck data sheet Q/H curve\nand NPSH or contact DESMI\nAs 5\nFit smaller V-belt pulley on\npump. Change RPM of\nelectric motor", "page_text_start": null, "page_text_end": null, "page_text_source": null, "bbox": {"x0": 349.27, "top": 343.61, "x1": 512.38, "bottom": 751.44}}]}]}], "warnings": []}
